    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877204e82d54e08c0735354f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到雪之美人拿着地图摸索陌生的道路，\n让我觉得像她这样子逛街，\n似乎也能当成一种体力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "158fa999ff169566ac4227887312ed5ed735d0ff73c8286d8847b02d9926ca1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
